{"holders":{"con":[],"pro":[],"proposition_id":"h7b5chm2"},"proposition":{"acknowledgements":{"acknowledged_undecided":0},"adoptable":true,"defined_by":null,"endcap_eligible":true,"equivalences":[],"holder_rows":[],"holders":0,"negation_proposition_id":"a9jncjw1","p":{"author":{"child":{"children":[{"node":"text","text":"A "},{"child":{"node":"text","text":"LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt"},"node":"tag","tag":{"binder_role":"use_site","def_id":"b7jema6y","hover_kind":"term","inlined_type_summary":"Prop","kind":"type","qualified_name":"nxtm3jbm.LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt","subexpr_pos":"/1","text":"LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt","token_id":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it::author/premise::1","token_role":null}}],"node":"append"},"node":"tag","tag":{"binder_role":"use_site","def_id":null,"hover_kind":"term","inlined_type_summary":"Prop","kind":"stdlib","qualified_name":"Axiom.Actual","subexpr_pos":"/","text":"A LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt","token_id":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it::author/premise::0","token_role":null}},"empty":{"child":{"children":[{"node":"text","text":"Axiom.Actual "},{"child":{"node":"text","text":"nxtm3jbm.LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt"},"node":"tag","tag":{"binder_role":"use_site","def_id":"b7jema6y","hover_kind":"term","inlined_type_summary":"Prop","kind":"type","qualified_name":"nxtm3jbm.LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt","subexpr_pos":"/1","text":"nxtm3jbm.LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt","token_id":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it::empty/premise::1","token_role":null}}],"node":"append"},"node":"tag","tag":{"binder_role":"use_site","def_id":null,"hover_kind":"term","inlined_type_summary":"Prop","kind":"stdlib","qualified_name":"Axiom.Actual","subexpr_pos":"/","text":"Axiom.Actual nxtm3jbm.LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt","token_id":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it::empty/premise::0","token_role":null}}},"p_author_source":{"author_byte_range":{"end":1393,"start":1364},"file_content":"import Axiom\nimport A.t0d1zdc3\nimport A.a4hsz51v\nimport A.ta3nj1a4\nimport A.r59jf3ak\n\nopen a4hsz51v\nopen ta3nj1a4\nopen r59jf3ak\nopen t0d1zdc3\n\nnamespace nxtm3jbm\n\nrigid universal Person extends Object := \"person\"\nrigid universal Store extends Object := \"store\"\n\nrelation ClosesAt : Store \"closes at\" TemporalInstant\nrelation CannotArriveBefore : Person \"cannot arrive at\" Store \"before\" TemporalInstant\nrelation CanMakeItTo : Person \"can make it to\" Store \"before\" TemporalInstant\n\ndef LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt : Prop :=\n  ∀ p s closing earliest : Type,\n    ClosesAt s closing →\n    CannotArriveBefore p s earliest →\n    Precedes closing earliest →\n    ¬ CanMakeItTo p s closing\n\ndef Sam : Type := \"the Axiom user sam\"\ndef TheStore : Type := \"the store sam intended to visit on the evening of 2026-08-06\"\ndef ClosingTime : Type := \"2026-08-06 21:00, the closing time of the store sam intended to visit\"\ndef EarliestArrival : Type :=\n  \"2026-08-06 21:10, the earliest sam could arrive at the store, leaving at 20:40 with a normal 30 minute travel time\"\n\nstructure TonightsStoreRun : Prop where\n  closes :\n    ClosesAt TheStore ClosingTime\n  cannot_arrive_before :\n    CannotArriveBefore Sam TheStore EarliestArrival\n  too_late :\n    Precedes ClosingTime EarliestArrival\n\ntheorem sam_cannot_make_it\n    (logic_is_actual : LogicIsActual)\n    (principle : A LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt)\n    (tonight : A TonightsStoreRun) :\n    A (¬ CanMakeItTo Sam TheStore ClosingTime) :=\n  logic_is_actual.mp _ _\n    (logic_is_actual.mp _ _\n      (logic_is_actual.actual_intro _\n        (fun (pr : LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt) (run : TonightsStoreRun) =>\n          pr Sam TheStore ClosingTime EarliestArrival\n            run.closes run.cannot_arrive_before run.too_late))\n      principle)\n    tonight\n\n/-\nThe same scenario in traditional first-order + modal notation:\n\n  Vocabulary:\n    Constants:   s (sam),  b (the store),  c (closing time, 21:00),  e (earliest arrival, 21:10)\n    Predicates:  Closes(x, t)      — store x closes at instant t\n                 ArrBef(x, y, t)   — x can arrive at y before t\n                 t ≺ t′            — instant t precedes instant t′\n    Modality:    ◇ₐ φ              — \"agent a is able to bring about φ\"\n\n  General principle (LateArrivalMeansNotMakingIt):\n    ∀x ∀y ∀t ∀t′ [ Closes(y, t) ∧ ¬ArrBef(x, y, t′) ∧ t ≺ t′ → ¬◇ₓ Shop(x, y, t) ]\n\n  Particular facts (TonightsStoreRun):\n    P1:  Closes(b, c)\n    P2:  ¬ArrBef(s, b, e)\n    P3:  c ≺ e\n\n  Derivation (sam_cannot_make_it):\n    1. Closes(b,c) ∧ ¬ArrBef(s,b,e) ∧ c ≺ e → ¬◇ₛ Shop(s,b,c)   (UI ×4 on the principle)\n    2. Closes(b,c) ∧ ¬ArrBef(s,b,e) ∧ c ≺ e                     (∧-intro on P1, P2, P3)\n    3. ¬◇ₛ Shop(s,b,c)                                          (MP on 1, 2)\n\n  Differences from the Lean version: the FOL signature leaves the sort of t/t′, the\n  theory of ≺, and the semantics of ◇ₐ unspecified — here ≺ is BFO's Precedes, the\n  ability modality is carried by the CanMakeItTo semantic string, the \"normally 30\n  minutes\" hedge lives inside the EarliestArrival particular (keeping the logic\n  classical rather than defaulting to a nonmonotonic system), and A (Actual) marks\n  the conclusion as action-guiding rather than merely entailed.\n-/\n\nend nxtm3jbm\n","source_tokens":[{"binder_role":null,"byte_end":1289,"byte_start":1282,"def_id":null,"hover_kind":null,"inlined_type_summary":null,"kind":"keyword","qualified_name":null,"text":"theorem","token_id":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it::src::0","token_role":null},{"binder_role":"def_site","byte_end":1308,"byte_start":1290,"def_id":"zrmptq7r","hover_kind":"term","inlined_type_summary":null,"kind":"identifier","qualified_name":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it","text":"sam_cannot_make_it","token_id":"nxtm3jbm.sam_cannot_make_it::src::1","token_role":null},{"binder_role":null,"byte_end":1314,"byte_start":1313,"def_id":null,"hover_kind":null,"inlined_type_summary":null,"kind":"op","qualified_name":null,"text":"(","token_id":"nxtm3jb